| `check_U` policy reachability | Refuses a practice whose policy document is more than one hop from the root `AGENT.md`. Non-string ids and references give grammar findings without raw text conversion; shared faults are reported once and a non-list `enforced_by` belongs to check_T. | `make check` | [a practice's `enforced_by`](settings.md#configpracticesjson) | Silent without a practices registry or without `AGENT.md`. | [coding-practices.md](../guides/coding-practices.md) | always |
